Week 8 - Created a heuristic baseline environment for 2 of the network slices, eaching sharing resources to see how fast each of their queues are being processed while each having a score based on delays
Week 9 - We created a controlled multi-slice environment using iPerf3 and tc by deploying three iPerf3 servers on different ports and shaping eth0 into three separate slices. We verified slice independence through zero jitter measurements and evaluated performance primarily based on bandwidth.
